{"instruction": "Tulis layout blog Tailwind dengan kad", "input": "", "output": "<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10\">\n  <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold\">Blog</h1>\n  <div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n    <article class=\"rounded-xl border bg-white overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\">\n      <div class=\"h-40 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-purple-500\"></div>\n      <div class=\"p-4\">\n        <time class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">10 Okt 2026</time>\n        <h2 class=\"mt-1 font-bold line-clamp-2\">Panduan Tailwind untuk pemula</h2>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"mt-2 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-blue-600 hover:underline\">Baca →</a>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n</div>\nGrid responsif 1→2→3 lajur; kad semantik `<article>` + `<time>`; hover bayang + pautan baca. Ulangi article untuk senarai."}
{"instruction": "Tulis layout dokumentasi Tailwind dengan sidebar", "input": "", "output": "<div class=\"flex min-h-screen\">\n  <aside class=\"sticky top-0 hidden h-screen w-64 shrink-0 overflow-y-auto border-r p-4 md:block\">\n    <p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase text-gray-400\">Panduan</p>\n    <nav class=\"mt-2 space-y-1\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"block rounded px-2 py-1 text-sm bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 font-medium\">Mula</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"block rounded px-2 py-1 text-sm hover:bg-gray-100\">Pemasangan</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"block rounded px-2 py-1 text-sm hover:bg-gray-100\">Konfigurasi</a>\n    </nav>\n  </aside>\n  <main class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 px-6 py-8 max-w-3xl\">\n    <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold\">Mula</h1>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 leading-7\">Pasang dengan satu arahan…</p>\n    <pre class=\"mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg bg-gray-900 p-4 text-sm text-gray-100\">npm i -D tailwindcss</pre>\n  </main>\n</div>\nSidebar sticky skrol sendiri (`h-screen overflow-y-auto`); kandungan `min-w-0` elak limpah flex; `max-w-3xl` kebolehbacaan. Blok kod gelap kontras."}
{"instruction": "Tulis grid e-dagang dengan penapis Tailwind", "input": "", "output": "<div class=\"flex gap-6\">\n  <aside class=\"hidden w-56 shrink-0 lg:block\">\n    <h3 class=\"font-bold text-sm\">Kategori</h3>\n    <label class=\"mt-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"rounded accent-blue-600\" checked> Kopi</label>\n    <label class=\"mt-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"rounded accent-blue-600\"> Teh</label>\n  </aside>\n  <div class=\"flex-1 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3\">\n    <div class=\"rounded-xl border p-4\">Produk <span class=\"font-bold\">RM25</span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\nSidebar penapis sticky desktop, tersembunyi mudah alih (drawer dengan JS); `accent-*` checkbox bertema; grid produk responsif 1→2→3."}
{"instruction": "Tulis skrin auth split Tailwind", "input": "", "output": "<div class=\"flex min-h-screen\">\n  <div class=\"hidden lg:flex w-1/2 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-700 to-purple-800 text-white p-12 flex-col justify-between\">\n    <p class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Jenama</p>\n    <blockquote class=\"text-xl\">“Alat terbaik tahun ini.”<footer class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-blue-200\">— CEO, Syarikat</footer></blockquote>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-center p-8\">\n    <form class=\"w-full max-w-sm space-y-4\">\n      <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Selamat kembali</h1>\n      <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Emel\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2\">\n      <input type=\"password\" placeholder=\"Kata laluan\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border px-3 py-2\">\n      <button class=\"w-full rounded-lg bg-blue-600 py-2 text-white font-semibold\">Masuk</button>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n</div>\nSplit jenama/testimoni (desktop sahaja) + borang tengah; gradien panel kiri; borang `max-w-sm` fokus. Corak SaaS piawai."}
{"instruction": "Tulis onboarding stepper Tailwind", "input": "", "output": "<ol class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n  <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n    <span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-sm font-bold text-white\">1</span>\n    <span class=\"text-sm font-medium\">Akaun</span>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gray-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></li>\n  <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 opacity-50\">\n    <span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border text-sm\">2</span>\n    <span class=\"text-sm\">Profil</span>\n  </li>\n</ol>\nLangkah siap (penuh biru) vs baki (opacity-50 + border); garis penyambung `h-px`. `<ol>` semantik + `aria-current=\"step\"` pada aktif untuk AT."}
{"instruction": "Tulis UI chat bubbles Tailwind", "input": "", "output": "<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-md space-y-2 p-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex justify-start\"><p class=\"max-w-[80%] rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm bg-gray-100 px-4 py-2 text-sm\">Hai, ada stok?</p></div>\n  <div class=\"flex justify-end\"><p class=\"max-w-[80%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-sm bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-white\">Ada, RM25 sekilo.</p></div>\n</div>\nKiri (kelabu, `rounded-bl-sm`) vs kanan (biru, `rounded-br-sm`); `max-w-[80%]` elak penuh; `justify-start/end` selang. Masa dengan `<time class=\"text-xs\">`."}
{"instruction": "Tulis kalendar bulan Tailwind grid", "input": "", "output": "<div class=\"max-w-md\">\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-7 gap-1 text-center text-xs font-bold text-gray-400\">\n    <span>Ahd</span><span>Isn</span><span>Sel</span><span>Rab</span><span>Kha</span><span>Jum</span><span>Sab</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mt-1 grid grid-cols-7 gap-1\">\n    <button class=\"aspect-square rounded-lg text-sm hover:bg-gray-100\">1</button>\n    <button class=\"aspect-square rounded-lg bg-blue-600 text-sm font-bold text-white\">10</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n`grid-cols-7` + `aspect-square` sel segi empat; hari ini ditanda (penuh biru); butang untuk interaksi (bukan div). Acara: titik `h-1 w-1 rounded-full` dalam sel."}
{"instruction": "Tulis invois Tailwind boleh cetak", "input": "", "output": "<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl p-8 print:p-0\">\n  <div class=\"flex justify-between\">\n    <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Invois #1042</h1>\n    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">10 Okt 2026</p>\n  </div>\n  <table class=\"mt-6 w-full text-sm\">\n    <thead><tr class=\"border-b text-left text-gray-500\"><th class=\"py-2\">Item</th><th class=\"py-2 text-right\">Harga</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"py-2\">Kopi ×2</td><td class=\"py-2 text-right\">RM50</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    <tfoot><tr class=\"font-bold\"><td class=\"py-2\">Jumlah</td><td class=\"py-2 text-right\">RM50</td></tr></tfoot>\n  </table>\n  <button class=\"mt-6 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-white print:hidden\" onclick=\"window.print()\">Cetak</button>\n</div>\n`print:` sorok butang + buang padding untuk kertas; `thead/tbody/tfoot` semantik; rata kanan angka (`tabular-nums` untuk lajur kemas)."}
{"instruction": "Tulis pengurus fail kad Tailwind", "input": "", "output": "<div class=\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\">\n  <div class=\"rounded-xl border p-4 hover:shadow-md hover:border-blue-300 cursor-pointer transition\">\n    <p class=\"text-3xl\">📁</p>\n    <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm font-medium truncate\">projek-akhir-v2</p>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">2.1 GB • semalam</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\nKad fail: ikon + nama truncate + meta saiz/masa; hover angkat (bayang+border) + cursor; klik pilih (JS tambah `ring-2`). Grid responsif 1→2→4."}
{"instruction": "Tulis bar pemain muzik Tailwind sticky", "input": "", "output": "<div class=\"fixed bottom-0 inset-x-0 border-t bg-white/90 backdrop-blur dark:bg-gray-900/90\">\n  <div class=\"h-1 w-full bg-gray-200\"><div class=\"h-1 w-1/3 bg-blue-600\"></div></div>\n  <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl flex items-center gap-4 px-4 py-3\">\n    <button aria-label=\"Main\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white\">▶</button>\n    <div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\">\n      <p class=\"truncate text-sm font-medium\">Lagu Pagi — Artis</p>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">1:20 / 3:45</p>\n    </div>\n    <input type=\"range\" class=\"w-24 accent-blue-600\" aria-label=\"Kelantangan\">\n  </div>\n</div>\nBar kemajuan nipis + kawalan + tajuk truncate + kelantangan (`accent-*`); `backdrop-blur` kaca terapung; `fixed bottom-0` kekal semasa skrol (beri `pb-20` pada kandungan)."}
{"instruction": "Tulis senarai notifikasi Tailwind berkumpulan", "input": "", "output": "<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-md divide-y rounded-xl border\">\n  <p class=\"px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase text-gray-400 bg-gray-50\">Hari ini</p>\n  <div class=\"flex gap-3 px-4 py-3 hover:bg-gray-50\">\n    <span class=\"mt-1 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-blue-600\"></span>\n    <div class=\"min-w-0\">\n      <p class=\"text-sm\"><b>Ali</b> membalas komen anda.</p>\n      <time class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">5 minit lalu</time>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n`divide-y` pemisah automatik; tajuk kumpulan sticky (`sticky top-0 bg`); titik biru belum-baca (`shrink-0` kekal bulat); `min-w-0` benarkan truncate dalam flex."}
{"instruction": "How do I migrate Tailwind v2 config to v4?", "input": "", "output": "1. Run `npx @tailwindcss/upgrade` (rewrites config + classes automatically). 2. Move `theme.extend` tokens into CSS `@theme { --color-brand: ...; }`. 3. Replace `tailwind.config.js` content with automatic detection (verify!). 4. Fix breaking changes: `border-color` defaults (`currentColor` now), dynamic spacing, removed deprecated utilities. 5. Visual-diff every page (screenshot compare) — automated migration plus human eyes."}
